# Publication allowlist: only reviewed game files and public documentation.
# All other local content stays on disk but is excluded from future git add.
# Add an explicit exception here when introducing a new game asset.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/style.css
!/script.js
!/startng.json
!/cover.png
!/README.md

# Never publish credentials or local environment files.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
